OL,5,G1200 Private Passions
OL,6,     FMichael Berkeley's guest is Louise
OL,7,     FKennedy, who worked as a chef for
OL,8,     F30 years before deciding to become
OL,9,     Fa writer and enjoying great
OL,10,     Fsuccess with her first novel,
OL,11,     FTrespasses.
OL,12,G1330 Music Map
OL,13,     FSara Mohr-Pietsch explores
OL,14,     FStravinsky's fantastical Firebird
OL,15,     FSuite, alongside Handel's
OL,16,     Fsorcerers, Bizet's circle dance
OL,17,     Fand Duke Ellington's magical
OL,18,     Foctotonic scale.
