OL,5,G1700 The Early Music Show
OL,6,     FHannah French, in conversation
OL,7,     Fwith Professor Laurie Stras of the
OL,8,     FUniversity of Huddersfield, seeks
OL,9,     Fthe real Lucrezia Borgia through
OL,10,     Fthe music she knew and loved.
OL,11,G1800 Choral Evensong
OL,12,     FFrom St James's Piccadilly,
OL,13,     FLondon, with Genesis Sixteen
OL,14,     FAlumni, with music by Lucy Walker,
OL,15,     FStanford, Will Todd and Howells.
OL,16,G1900 BBC Young Musician Final 2026
OL,17,     FAlpesh Chauhan and the BBC
OL,18,     FNational Orchestra of Wales join
OL,19,     Fthree young musicians in the Final
OL,20,     Fof the BBC Young Musician 2026
OL,21,     Ffrom Bristol Beacon.
